Source: vacti-appliance-skin
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Vacti <ops@vacti.example>
Build-Depends: debhelper (>= 10)
Standards-Version: 4.6.0

Package: vacti-appliance-skin
Architecture: all
Depends: dpkg (>= 1.17.6), coreutils, systemd, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: vacti-engine (>= 0.2.452), lightdm, network-manager, plymouth-themes
Provides: vacti-appliance-skin
Description: Vacti appliance skin + lockdown retrofit for live kali hosts
 Backports the vacti-distro appliance brand (plymouth, GRUB, LightDM greeter,
 PS1, MOTD) plus the B3 GREEN lockdown subset (polkit power neutralize,
 ctrl-alt-del mask, sysrq=0, getty tty2-6 mask) onto a running Kali or Debian
 host. Idempotent install; dpkg-divert --rename on remove restores originals.
 Optional kali->arparp user migration via /usr/libexec/vacti-appliance-skin/migrate-user.sh.
